        "title": "feat(tools): add sessions_reset manual intervention tool for Issue #99586",
        "body": "This PR adds a manual intervention tool to help operators recover from wedged session tool state.\n\n## Problem\nRuntime tool surface deadlocks can occur when plugin approvals get stuck, causing cascading failures across sessions.\n\n## Solution\nAdded  tool that supports scope-based cleanup:\n- : reset pending tool call locks\n- : reset pending plugin approvals\n- : reset both locks and approvals\n\nCan target a specific session or all sessions.\n\nThis is part of a 4-layer defense mechanism against tool deadlocks (Issue #99586).\n\n## Related\nFixes: #99586",
